DESCRIPTION:An apparently idyllic house boat trip is thrown into disarray w
 hen Diane (Rabe) and her children are rocked by revelations of financial st
 rife kept secret by obstinate husband Ray (Ifans). At sea and with a chaoti
 c holiday ahead of them\, the family struggles to keep it together and face
  an uncertain future\, but not before competing in a truly epic fishing com
 petition. With an easy-going charm\, affection for its complex characters\,
  and a real sense of place\, Lindsey Ryan’s beautifully filmed and hilari
 ous American indie debut tackles a very contemporary story of economic unce
 rtainty with optimism\, warmth and humour.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.
 app/comedy-atlas/event/capsized/
